      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_02",
      "hash64": "7074FE3D9FB32FBF",
      "text": "¿Tú también vienes a menear el bigote?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_01",
      "hash64": "41E2A3C4A8BB79C1",
      "text": "Sí, pero sin bigote",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_02",
      "hash64": "41E2A0C4A8BB74A8",
      "text": "No, pasaba por aquí",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_03a",
      "hash64": "C9F8BCB65D77E337",
      "text": "¡Ja! Excelente. No es recomendable combatir\\ncon el estómago vacío.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_03b",
      "hash64": "C9F8BDB65D77E4EA",
      "text": "Atraíd[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa por el irresistible aroma de la comida,\\nseguro.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_04",
      "hash64": "7074FC3D9FB32C59",
      "text": "Yo he venido en calidad de supervisor, por así\\ndecirlo.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_05",
      "hash64": "7074FB3D9FB32AA6",
      "text": "Quiero comprobar la calidad de los alimentos\\nque los alumnos consumen habitualmente.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_06",
      "hash64": "7074FA3D9FB328F3",
      "text": "De entre toda la oferta, me llama especialmente\\nel bocadillo de crema de cacahuete.\\c\\nPromete ser tan dulce como delicioso.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_07",
      "hash64": "7074F93D9FB32740",
      "text": "Creo que voy a pedirme uno...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_01",
      "hash64": "72BB0B4A3B889909",
      "text": "Mira, es Hugo. ¡Él siempre tan impecable!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_02",
      "hash64": "72BB084A3B8893F0",
      "text": "No sabía que los profes también vinieran aquí.\\n¿Crees que se pedirá el de huevo cocido?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_03",
      "hash64": "72BB094A3B8895A3",
      "text": "¡Qué va! A él le pega más algo fuerte, como el\\nbocadillo osado.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_mob_04",
      "hash64": "72BB0E4A3B889E22",
      "text": "Es verdad, le va que ni pintado. Fijo que se pide\\nese.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_08",
      "hash64": "7075083D9FB340BD",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_09",
      "hash64": "7075073D9FB33F0A",
      "text": "¿Me pones un... bocadillo osado, por favor?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_03",
      "hash64": "41E2A1C4A8BB765B",
      "text": "¿Ese? ¿Seguro?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_select_04",
      "hash64": "41E2A6C4A8BB7EDA",
      "text": "¿Y el de crema de cacahuete?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_10",
      "hash64": "7071FA3D9FB0F31C",
      "text": "Oh, es verdad, me habías hablado maravillas del\\nde crema de cacahuete. Seguiré tu consejo.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_11",
      "hash64": "7071FB3D9FB0F4CF",
      "text": "Uf, ha faltado poco para pedirme uno picante...\\n¡Y eso que yo no aguanto el picante![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_12",
      "hash64": "7071FC3D9FB0F682",
      "text": "Agradezco tu intervención, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_13",
      "hash64": "7071FD3D9FB0F835",
      "text": "Parece que aquí el alumnado se ha creado una\\nimagen de mí que no corresponde a la realidad.\\c\\nMe ven y me imaginan tomando un café solo\\ndespués de una sesión de pesas, supongo, je.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 181,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_14",
      "hash64": "7071F63D9FB0EC50",
      "text": "Ay, y yo tengo mi parte de culpa por cultivar esa\\nmisma imagen para no decepcionarlos.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_15",
      "hash64": "7071F73D9FB0EE03",
      "text": "Hoy te he mostrado sin quererlo una faceta de\\nmí que los demás desconocen...\\r\\nPor favor, que quede entre nosotros.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_home_b_system_01",
      "hash64": "1F8785FE16DAD786",
      "text": "¡Ahora te llevas aún mejor con Hugo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
